## English Summary (for reference only — the Chinese text above is authoritative)

You may use, copy, distribute, and modify this work **for non-commercial educational purposes only**, provided you keep this license and the copyright notice intact, credit the original author with a link back, and license any derivative under the same terms.

Teachers modifying scripts or exercises for their own classes are explicitly permitted — that is the intended use.

**Commercial use of any kind is prohibited** without prior written permission. This includes selling it to schools, bundling it into paid courses, or using it to train commercial models.

No textbook text is included in this repository. Textbook rights belong to the original publisher.

The work is provided "as is". **No controlled classroom study has been run**, so no learning gain is claimed.

